</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d4db8858-d7a3-11f1-96d0-bf1914cabd52/w:1024/p:16x9/titre-1.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d4db8858-d7a3-11f1-96d0-bf1914cabd52/w:1024/p:16x9/titre-1.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">08869bfc-d7a4-11f1-8efb-13798a91479a</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:50:55 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>US midterm elections: Over 58 million Americans cast early ballots</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261103-us-midterm-elections-over-58-million-americans-cast-early-ballots</link><description>
